WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-06 - Just a Girl
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: 1987: Electric Color

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.500
[Shimmering Analog Synth Intro]

00:00:17.626 --> 00:00:21.500
They tell me "sing the high note"

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:26.000
They tell me "wear the red dress"

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.200
They never ask me what I wrote

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:35.000
They only want to see the press

00:00:36.982 --> 00:00:41.500
I bring my chords, my melody

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:46.200
They pat my head and disagree

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:51.000
They turn to him, "now that's a sound"

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.500
And I'm just standing in the background

00:00:55.800 --> 00:01:00.000
Am I ever gonna break through?

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.200
Am I ever gonna get my due?

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:10.000
Or am I just a girl in the band?

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:15.200
A pretty picture, holding your hand

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:20.200
They say "be 'Stardust', be the grace"

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:25.000
"Know your role and keep your place"

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:29.500
But I am more than what you see

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:34.300
I'm fighting just to be... me

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:39.200
Am I ever gonna break through?

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:44.000
Am I ever gonna get my due?

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:48.500
Or am I just a girl in the band?

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:54.000
A pretty picture, holding your hand

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:59.800
But the music's in my blood

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:04.500
The synth, the key, the flood

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:10.500
You can't erase the fire

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:16.000
My voice is getting higher

00:02:16.436 --> 00:02:21.200
Am I ever gonna break through?

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:26.500
Am I ever gonna get my due?

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:31.200
Or am I just a girl in the band?

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:36.500
A pretty picture, holding your hand

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:44.000
Just a girl...

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:52.000
Just a girl...

00:02:52.000 --> 00:03:00.500
[Fades out on a shimmering synth pad]
